        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Sci-Fi RPG on a small map.  We meet a humanoid that has arrived on a mysterious alien island on a remote planet in a far away galaxy.  Help her explore.  Meet some old friends.  Or take off in her Spacejet.  In this game you can explore a small map.  Basically you have a choice whether or not you want to walk around as my character The Spacejet Pilot or Fly.   The SJP's an Android many distant years in the future.  A future where anything technological is indescernable from magic.  None of that is in the game.  The game you just walk around this small map and maybe talk to some NPCs.  If you fall in a hole too bad there's no way out.  Controls are simple WASD and Space plus Esc to leave the hole you just fell into and go back to the menu where you can FLY.  Yes that's right.  Take off in the Spacejet.  Fly around a little.  There's not much else to do.  Enjoy the sunset I suppose.  Oh you can fight.  If that's what you're into.  </p>",
